uls [[Cookbook:olive oil|olive oil]]\n* 2 spoonfuls [[Cookbook:Vinegar|vinegar]]\n* 2 [[Cookbook:Hard Boiled Eggs|hard-boiled egg]] yolks, mashed\n* Small amount of [[Cookbook:Mince|minced]] [[Cookbook:Onion|onions]]\n* 1 spoonful [[Cookbook:anchovy|anchovy]] sauce\n\n== Procedure ==\n\n# Pass the potatoes through a [[Cookbook:Sieve|sieve]] or a ricer.\n# Combine potatoes and remaining ingredients. Mix well.\n\n== References ==\n* ''The Dictionary of American Food and Drink'', J.F. Mariani, Ticknor & Fields, New Haven, Connecticut, 1983. {{ISBN|0-89919-199-1}} Library of Congress TX349.M26\n\n[[Category:Recipes using egg yolk]]\n[[Category:Recipes using anchovy]]\n[[Category:Recipes for salad dressing]]\n[[Category:Recipes using prepared mustard]]","isRecipe":true,"recipe":{"name":"Sydney Smith's Salad Dressing","nameAr":null,"servings":null,"servingsSourceText":null,"ingredients":[{"id":"source-line-1","name":"2 boiled potatoes","sourceText":"2 boiled potatoes","amountText":"2 boiled potatoes","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-2","name":"1 spoonful mustard","sourceText":"1 spoonful mustard","amountText":"1 spoonful mustard","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-3","name":"2 spoonfuls salt","sourceText":"2 spoonfuls salt","amountText":"2 spoonfuls salt","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-4","name":"4 spoonfuls olive oil","sourceText":"4 spoonfuls olive oil","amountText":"4 spoonfuls olive oil","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-5","name":"2 spoonfuls vinegar","sourceText":"2 spoonfuls vinegar","amountText":"2 spoonfuls vinegar","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-6","name":"2 hard-boiled egg yolks, mashed","sourceText":"2 hard-boiled egg yolks, mashed","amountText":"2 hard-boiled egg yolks, mashed","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-7","name":"Small amount of minced onions","sourceText":"Smal